DoubleFloatsX

This package is a modified version of DoubleFloats.jl, Copyright (c) 2018-2023 Julia Math, released under the MIT
License. LICENSE is upstream's licence, kept unchanged, and covers the whole package.

Upstream: https://github.com/JuliaMath/DoubleFloats.jl, admitted at its release v1.12.0 (commit
60b72cae8a53577c170afab0d48a011a853d1a96, tree 00720e467f998dc28d6bd3ec2fe33b1d04155f6c); UPSTREAM.toml records it with
the patches carried on top of it. The repository carries upstream's history; upstream's tags are kept as upstream/<tag>.

Modifications (each changed contract is a row of README.md, "Differences from upstream"):
- 2026-11-12: upstream's GitHub workflows and Dependabot configuration removed (this repository runs no hosted CI);
  the stray src/math/.DS_Store removed; the family's tooling added (AGENTS.md, NOTICE, UPSTREAM.toml, justfile,
  .githooks/, tools/, format/, .JuliaFormatter.toml).
- 2026-11-12: the package renamed DoubleFloatsX with its own UUID and version 0.1.0-DEV, Project.toml's repo naming
  this repository; its module and every qualification by the old name in code renamed; the exported type names
  unchanged (DFX-001).
- 2026-11-13: conversion to every fixed-width integer type exact, of the target type and allocation-free, with
  Integer, Signed and Unsigned added, upstream's integer convert removed for Base's, and round, floor, ceil and trunc
  to an integer type defined for every width, decided on the limbs (DFX-002); floor, ceil and trunc exact (DFX-003); round's ties to even and the nearest modes
  decided on the limbs (DFX-004); in src/type/constructors.jl, src/type/convert.jl,
  src/math/prearith/floorceiltrunc.jl and src/extras/misc.jl (the floatmin2 constants, recomputed with the exact
  trunc), with test/integers.jl added to the tests; version 0.2.0.
- 2026-11-14: loggamma of a Complex{Double64} added to SpecialFunctions' function, and, in the package extension
  DoubleFloatsXGammaExt over the weak dependency Gamma, to Gamma.jl's with Gamma.gamma, Gamma.loggamma and
  Gamma.logabsgamma of a Double64 (DFX-005); in src/math/special/loggamma.jl, ext/DoubleFloatsXGammaExt.jl and
  src/DoubleFloatsX.jl, with test/loggamma.jl, its Arb fixture test/fixtures/loggamma_arb.tsv and the tools that
  write and qualify it, tools/loggamma/; Gamma and HypergeometricFunctions added to the test targets.
